      "side": 1,
      "message": "A way to avoid duplicating the `MaybeUninit` code would be to have function\n```\nfn avb_footer_from_bytes(bytes: [u8; size_of::\u003cAvbFooter\u003e()]) -\u003e Option\u003cAvbFooter\u003e\n```\n\nor (even better) a constructor `AvbFooter::from_(raw_)bytes` or `impl TryFrom\u003c[u8; size_of::\u003cAvbFooter\u003e()]\u003e for AvbFooter`.",
