      "lineNbr": 239,
      "author": {
        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T09:21:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added `Footer` and `try_from(bytes)` for now.\n\nCurrently, the error from `try_from(bytes)` is not raised as an error in comparison with `try_from(image)`. To make both of them take the `TryInto` form here, maybe we need to add another VbImageVerificationError here and propagate it. I think that will require some investigation and an additional test. I\u0027d prefer to leave it to a different cl, wdyt?",
      "parentUuid": "ce0ed6c8_c6671541",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 239,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 239,
        "endChar": 26
